    "title": "BIDS App - fmriprep_ciftify.invocationSchema",
    "type": "object"
  },
  "description": "Dear team,\n\nWe will run the fmriprep\u2011ciftify pipeline on the BIDS dataset located at **/data/bids**, writing all results to the derivatives folder **/data/derivatives**. The execution is set for the **participant** analysis level, with anatomical\u2011only processing turned off. Our CIFTIFY configuration can be found at **/configs/ciftify.yaml**, and we will operate in **debug** mode. The FreeSurfer license required for surface reconstruction is stored at **/opt/license.txt**. Functional preprocessing will be labeled with the descriptor **desc-preproc_bold** and placed in the directory **func_preproc**. We are not ignoring fieldmaps (**ignore_fieldmaps = false**) and we will not skip susceptibility\u2011distortion correction (**no_SDC = false**). Symbolic links are disabled (the **no_symlinks** option is set to \u201coff\u201d), and the flag indicating an older fmriprep version is explicitly set to **false**. Processing will be limited to participants **01** and **02**, within session **ses-01**, and we will read the necessary derivatives from the **fmriprep** output. The pipeline is allowed to rerun completed steps (**rerun_if_complete = true**) but will not resample to the T1w\u201132k space (**resample_to_T1w32k = false**). We will use **8 CPUs**, apply a **6\u202fmm** smoothing kernel (FWHM), and perform surface registration to **fsaverage5**. The MSM configuration is **MSMAll**, and we will include the tasks **rest** and **task** in the processing. Verbose logging is enabled.\n\nPlease let me know if any adjustments are needed before we launch the run.",
  "reference_json": {
    "bids_dir": "/data/bids",
    "output_dir": "/data/derivatives",
    "analysis_level": "participant",
    "anat_only": false,
    "ciftify_conf": "/configs/ciftify.yaml",
    "debug": true,
    "freesurfer_license": "/opt/license.txt",
    "func_preproc_desc": "desc-preproc_bold",
    "func_preproc_dirname": "func_preproc",
    "ignore_fieldmaps": false,
    "msm_config": "MSMAll",
    "n_cpus": 8,
    "no_SDC": false,
    "no_symlinks": "off",
    "older_fmriprep": false,
    "participant_label": [
      "01",
      "02"
    ],
    "read_from_derivatives": "fmriprep",
    "rerun_if_complete": true,
    "resameple_to_T1w32k": false,
    "session_label": [
      "ses-01"
    ],
    "smooth_fwhm": 6.0,
    "surf_reg": "fsaverage5",
    "task_label": [
      "rest",
      "task"
    ],
    "verbose": true
  }
